OL,3,GNEWSASinger's journey from foster care
OL,4,Ato The Voice
OL,5,
OL,6,FA singer who spent part of his
OL,7,Fchildhood growing up in foster care
OL,8,Fsays making it through the blind
OL,9,Fauditions of The Voice UK felt like a
OL,10,F"pinch me" moment.
OL,12,FDiogo Ferreira, 28, who lives in
OL,13,FBristol, performed on ITV's first
OL,14,Fepisode of the season in front of the
OL,15,Fshow's celebrity judges.
OL,17,FAll four judges turned their chairs
OL,18,Fduring his performance, giving him the
OL,19,Fchoice of which team to join. He
OL,20,Feventually picked Will.i.am, dedicating
OL,21,Fhis song to "finding love".
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
