OL,3,GNEWSASinger's journey from foster care
OL,4,Ato The Voice
OL,5,
OL,6,FFerreira, who will next appear in the
OL,7,Fbattle stage of the show, said: "I've
OL,8,Fjust always chased the dream of
OL,9,Fbecoming a musician and a singer. I
OL,10,Fdidn't get lessons or anything like
OL,11,Fthat. I just practised."
